              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kevin"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I like it. It's interesting, easy to make, and a cheap. I've never made pancakes by baking them before. But I will say you need milk on hand as it's not nearly enough liquid to make a batter. The end result is very sweet and is more akin to a giant cookie or a dessert pastry, but it's still pretty tasty!",
