              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Blessed"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Delicious!! More of a cake than a pancake though. Be sure to add some water. There was no way it would become a batter without it.... Unless I did something wrong. Minus adding a tiny bit of water, I followed the recipe exactly.",
