            "reviewBody": "Easy pancake recipe, I like it and thank you for posting.",
            "datePublished": "2010-08-18T00:51:32.920Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "3"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sarah Jo"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I completely changed this recipe. Just looking at it, I knew it wouldn't work. I changed the sugar to half brown, half regular. I used a whole egg and added in a 1/2 tsp. of vanilla. I had to add in a cup of buttermilk because the batter was void of all moisture aside from the egg. Oh, and I also added a 1/2 tsp. of pumpkin pie spice. This made it possible for me to cook it on my countertop griddle. They were good, but not fantastic. I liked that I was able to use up a can of fruit cocktail, but I think it was better in theory. I don't see how this recipe could work as written. I doubt I'll make them again, but it was nice to experiment.",
            "datePublished": "2008-07-03T08:10:39.847Z"
          }
